  description: '"Fallen of Albaz" + 1 LIGHT or DARK monster + 1 Effect Monster

    While
    an "Ecclesia" monster is on the field or in either GY, this card gains 500 ATK,
    also it is unaffected by other cards'' effects. You can only use each of the
    following effects of "The Dragon that Devours the Dogma" once per turn. If this
    card is Special Summoned: You can shuffle up to 2 cards from any GY(s) and/or
    banishment into the Deck. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because
    it was sent there this turn: You can add 1 "Dogmatika" or "Tri-Brigade" card
    from your Deck to your hand.'
